  "limitations": [
    "Lack of consideration of participant population and diversity, limiting generalizability (e.g., different working positions, health conditions).",
    "Neglect of the application position of wood on furniture (e.g., desk tops vs. other elements).",
    "Study only involved visual senses, potentially leading to a weaker sense of experience in the office context.",
    "Future research should incorporate other sensory evaluations (touch, smell) and immersive experiences (VR helmets/glasses, tactile gloves) to enhance the sense of experience and objectivity.",
    "Future studies could include eye-movement and EEG experiments to further explore sensory evaluation, affective responses, and tendency to act."
